    <detaileddescription>
<para>ThemisDB Time Series Auto-Batching Buffer</para>
<para>Automatic buffering of single data points for batch compression. Inspired by CEPEngine event buffering and BackpressureProtocol adaptive strategies.</para>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Configurable buffer size and flush intervals</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Per-metric:entity buffering</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread-safe operation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic flush on size/time thresholds</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Manual flush support</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Integration with existing <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_store" kindref="compound">TSStore</ref></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
